From: PonWrt developers <noreply@localhost>
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: net: describe HG5585F host-managed PPE

Describe the explicit Ethernet selection for a Linux-managed PPE with
the HG5585F 2024 WLAN firmware ABI.

---
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/net/airoha,en7581-eth.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/net/airoha,en7581-eth.yaml
@@ -72,6 +72,13 @@
 
   "#size-cells":
     const: 0
+
+  airoha,hg5585f-ppe:
+    type: boolean
+    description:
+      Use host-managed PPE initialization with the HG5585F 2024 NPU
+      firmware ABI. Linux owns the FOE table and programs the PPE directly.
+      Firmware flow statistics are unavailable in this mode.
 
   airoha,npu:
     $ref: /schemas/types.yaml#/definitions/phandle
